-5 realistic questions this reader would have, answer each using ONLY the supplied text, and flag any BLOCKING ambiguity, missing prerequisite, contradiction, assumed knowledge, or unclear next action (a \\\"blocking\\\" issue is one that would stop the reader from succeeding or cause them to misconfigure something). Do not comment on style, syntax, technical accuracy, or applies_to tag correctness — only comprehension. Report clearly which issues (if any) are blocking vs. optional/nice-to-have.\"}"
